{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DefaultListenersMergeMode = \"replace\" | \"append\" | \"prepend\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L20","children":[{"type":"text","value":"defaultOptions.public.ts:20"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Determines how a supplied usage-site listener array combines with default\nlisteners."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'append'"},{"type":"text","value":" runs default listeners before usage-site listeners. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'prepend'"},{"type":"text","value":"\nruns usage-site listeners first. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'replace'"},{"type":"text","value":" uses only the usage-site\nlisteners. Omitting the usage-site property keeps the defaults, while\nexplicitly setting it to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" suppresses them."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefaultListenersMergeMode = \"replace\" | \"append\" | \"prepend\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L20)\n\nDetermines how a supplied usage-site listener array combines with default\nlisteners.\n\n`'append'` runs default listeners before usage-site listeners. `'prepend'`\nruns usage-site listeners first. `'replace'` uses only the usage-site\nlisteners. Omitting the usage-site property keeps the defaults, while\nexplicitly setting it to `undefined` suppresses them.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefaultListenersMergeMode\ntitle: DefaultListenersMergeMode\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefaultListenersMergeMode = \"replace\" | \"append\" | \"prepend\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L20)\n\nDetermines how a supplied usage-site listener array combines with default\nlisteners.\n\n`'append'` runs default listeners before usage-site listeners. `'prepend'`\nruns usage-site listeners first. `'replace'` uses only the usage-site\nlisteners. Omitting the usage-site property keeps the defaults, while\nexplicitly setting it to `undefined` suppresses them.\n"}
